{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"上水地盤工人疑失平衡跌倒　遭鐵枝插傷下顎送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PAI-SS-261030-14.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】上水一名地盤工人懷疑失平衡跌倒，遭鐵枝插傷下顎。</p><p>受傷地盤工人獲救後，送到威爾斯親王醫院。</p><p>警方早上10時許接報，清曉路一名工人在一個地盤工作時懷疑失平衡跌倒，下顎遭鐵枝插中。消防到場將鐵枝鋸斷，協助將工人救出。警方通知勞工處跟進調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:35.062831+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:14:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:08.728698+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:53.317552+00:00","content_hash":"e425c3559f244dac70078958fb7363c0bb7f46c4232dd5300fe06a20313cdedd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}